                <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Run one denoising step of <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathcolor="#808080">𝒢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}</annotation></semantics></math> to get <math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">z</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">t</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>

